  "plot": "A Los Angeles detective carries the quiet rot of long service. When a brazen killer begins butchering young women, the case slips under his skin and starts living there. Evidence piles up. Proof never sticks. Courts shrug while the predator circles closer to home. Pressure builds inside the detective until restraint feels like surrender. The hunt stops being professional duty and turns personal. Pride, rage, and fear twist together as he pushes past the law he once served, gambling everything on the belief that he alone sees the truth before the next strike.",
